&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage Two:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Hiring Manager Interview&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage Three:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;US Team Interview &amp;amp; Technical Assessment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage Four:&lt;/strong&gt; Executive Interview - CPO&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We always aim to stick to the above process; however, there may be occasions when an additional interview stage is required for us to be sure we are hiring the right person!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HIRING LOCATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;📍&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re currently able to consider applications from candidates based in Ontario (Canada) and the following US states: Connecticut, Florida, New Jersey, New York and North Carolina.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fully remote role. You&#39;ll be expected to travel occasionally for team and customer meetings, primarily to New York, with occasional travel to the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
