&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT FORM3&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;💭&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Form3, we&#39;re building the technology that powers the future of account-to-account payments, helping banks and financial institutions deliver faster, smarter and more resilient payment experiences.&amp;nbsp;We&#39;re committed to creating a flexible, inclusive workplace where people can do their best work. As a remote-first company, we support flexible working patterns and offer part-time opportunities where possible. We continually invest in our people through a competitive benefits package, although these vary by location. Speak to our Talent Team to learn what&#39;s available where you are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information about life at Form3, check out the following pages:&lt;/p&gt;
